      "question": "Six letters P, Q, R, S, T and U are written on different faces of a dice. Three different positions of this dice are shown in the figure. Select the letter that will be on the face opposite to the one having Q.\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/354452c363b00e66a0125eecd35cd1a7549680e666887e0a33a39850ce510181.png]",
