        },
        {
          "label": "4",
          "text": "28"
        }
      ],
      "correct": "3",
      "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLogic: (1st number)² + 3 = 2nd number.\n\nNow,\n\nFor, 8 : 67\n\n⇒ (8)² + 3 = 64 + 3 = 67.\n\nFor, 4 : 19\n\n⇒ (4)²+ 3 = 16 + 3 = 19.\n\nSimilarly, for 6 ∶ ?\n\n**⇒ (6)² + 3 = 36 + 3 = 39.**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
      "tags": [
