      "correct": "3",
      "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9f1f11fbb4e091305a6b414e74c3aec25b8d519670a1f3bd65f5bd4eb1bdcd68.png] \n\nGiven equation: 264 * 4 * 7 * 87 * 370 * 5 \n\nOption 1) ×− = + ÷\n\nSigns that can sequentially replace the * signs:\n\n⇒ __**264 × 4**__ - 7 = 87 + __**370 ÷ 5**__ \n\n⇒ __1056____** - 7**__ = __**87 +**__ __74__ \n\n⇒ 1049 = 161\n\nOption 2) ÷ ×− + =\n\nSigns that can sequentially replace the * signs:\n\n⇒ __**264 ÷ 4**__ × 7 - 87 + 370 = 5 \n\n⇒ __66____** ×**____** 7**__ - 87 + 370 = 5 \n\n⇒ **__462__** - 87 __**+ 370**__ = 5 \n\n⇒ __832____** - 87**__ = 5 \n\n⇒ 745 = 5 \n\n**Option 3) ÷ ×− = +**\n\nSigns that can sequentially replace the * signs:\n\n⇒ __**264 ÷ 4**__ × 7 - 87 = __**370 + 5 **__\n\n⇒ **__66__**__** ×**____** 7**__ - 87 = 375 \n\n⇒ **__462__**__** -**____** 87**__ = 375 \n\n***⇒ 375 = 375 ***\n\nOption 4) ÷ × = + −\n\nSigns that can sequentially replace the * signs:\n\n⇒ __**264 ÷ 4**__ × 7 = __**87 + 370**__ - 5\n\n⇒ __66____** ×**____** 7**__ = __**457**____** - 5**__\n\n⇒ 462 = 452\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**÷ ×− = +**\".",
